  81:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****       (+) For the asynchronous mode the parameters below can be configured:
  82:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Baud Rate
  83:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Word Length
  84:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Stop Bit
  85:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Parity: If the parity is enabled, then the MSB bit of the data written
  86:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****              in the data register is transmitted but is changed by the parity bit.
  87:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****         (++) Hardware flow control
