 104:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c **** 
 105:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   Depending on the frame length defined by the M1 and M0 bits (7-bit,
 106:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   8-bit or 9-bit), the possible UART formats are listed in the
 107:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   following table.
 108:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c **** 
 109:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     Table 1. UART frame format.
 110:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     +-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
 111:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |  M1 bit |  M0 bit |  PCE bit  |             UART frame                |
 112:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 113:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    0    |    0      |    | SB |    8 bit data   | STB |     |
 114:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 115:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    0    |    1      |    | SB | 7 bit data | PB | STB |     |
 116:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 117:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    1    |    0      |    | SB |    9 bit data   | STB |     |
 118:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 119:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    1    |    1      |    | SB | 8 bit data | PB | STB |     |
 120:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 121:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    1    |    0    |    0      |    | SB |    7 bit data   | STB |     |
 122:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 123:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    1    |    0    |    1      |    | SB | 6 bit data | PB | STB |     |
 124:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     +-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
