 130:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @brief Initialize the RS485 Driver enable feature according to the specified
 131:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *         parameters in the UART_InitTypeDef and creates the associated handle.
 132:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @param huart            UART handle.
 133:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @param Polarity         Select the driver enable polarity.
 134:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 135:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *          @arg @ref UART_DE_POLARITY_HIGH DE signal is active high
 136:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *          @arg @ref UART_DE_POLARITY_LOW  DE signal is active low
 137:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @param AssertionTime    Driver Enable assertion time:
 138:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       5-bit value defining the time between the activation of the DE (Driver Enable)
 139:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       signal and the beginning of the start bit. It is expressed in sample time
 140:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       units (1/8 or 1/16 bit time, depending on the oversampling rate)
 141:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   * @param DeassertionTime  Driver Enable deassertion time:
 142:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       5-bit value defining the time between the end of the last stop bit, in a
 143:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       transmitted message, and the de-activation of the DE (Driver Enable) signal.
 144:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       It is expressed in sample time units (1/8 or 1/16 bit time, depending on the
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccUga7Nf.s 			page 4


 145:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****   *       oversampling rate).
